    "detailed_description": "As a manager of an hospital near bankrupt, you find that a brick on the head will give you patients. Throw objects in the streets along four worlds with levels full of madness and fun. Also play on <strong>Hospital Mode</strong> where you can build your own hospital, take care of patients, protect him with security guards...<br><br><strong>Pick carefully your items for every level, there a lot ways to play!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592000/extras/8b4367b4573af25a006194eaacc12fc3.poster.avif?t=1704651449\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592000/extras/8b4367b4573af25a006194eaacc12fc3.webm?t=1704651449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592000/extras/8b4367b4573af25a006194eaacc12fc3.mp4?t=1704651449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Different types of Enemies and Allies!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592000/extras/74ee2b2a6b800a3801f6d4f34fcebd62.poster.avif?t=1704651449\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592000/extras/74ee2b2a6b800a3801f6d4f34fcebd62.webm?t=1704651449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592000/extras/74ee2b2a6b800a3801f6d4f34fcebd62.mp4?t=1704651449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Build your own hospital in &quot;Hospital Mode&quot;!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s